tUzZnM2szTGpYQlU5WkNUX014eDMtNC1YYk1zWTd0RXFqaGNBcmRxYkdaWUx3dEQwSlAwWjJtXzRsb3NJSTlKOUdrQ2JiMjk5V2hGX0ZORDdR?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":"8-K：UDR 公司 | 8-K：UDR, INC. 公佈 2026 年第二季業績並上調 2026 年全年指引範圍"},{"title":"REIT Sells 400-Unit Arlandria Apartment Community For $69M","src":"Bisnow","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQRDg1RnNTaXRMQ0xIYUZLZXhheHBtY3RpSGZfV0cxT056OHV0WFUzWC1HZDZ3WGItOXlLLS1ZVWp6YjNSM0pMSm9yREFPZHVlZHloRmN4aHlleDZnRTBCUWdSeVdOUnY2VlFIbHZqSUdxcl92NmZUYjZjX1loYVlXcFZDbjZMeG43MTlseXJ0NWROdjNPVWtwbXhwRG92c1RuNzRz?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":"REIT 以 6,900 萬美元出售 400 套 Arlandria 公寓社區"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/74208/000007420826000013/udr-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"UDR is a self-administered real estate investment trust, or REIT, that owns, operates, acquires, renovates, develops, redevelops, disposes of, and manages multifamily apartment communities in targeted markets located in the United States. At December 31, 2025, our consolidated real estate portfolio consisted of 165 communities located in 21 markets, consisting of 55,240 completed apartment homes, which are held directly or through our subsidiaries, including the Operating Partnership and the DownREIT Partnership, and consolidated joint ventures. In addition, we have an ownership interest in 12,167 completed or to-be-completed apartment homes through unconsolidated joint ventures or partnerships, including 6,766 apartment homes owned by entities in which we hold preferred equity investments. At December 31, 2025, the Company was developing one wholly-owned community totaling 300 apartment","zh":"UDR 是一家自我管理的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)，在美國目標市場擁有、經營、收購、翻新、開發、再開發、處置和管理多戶公寓社區。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的綜合房地產投資組合由分佈在 21 個市場的 165 個社區組成，其中包括 55,240 套已竣工的公寓房，這些公寓由我們直接或透過我們的子公司（包括營運合夥企業和 DownREIT 合夥企業）以及綜合合資企業持有。此外，我們透過未合併的合資企業或合夥企業擁有 12,167 套已竣工或即將竣工的公寓房的所有權權益，其中包括我們持有優先股投資的實體擁有的 6,766 套公寓房。截至2025年12月31日，公司正在開發1個全資社區，共300套公寓"},{"en":"UDR has elected to be taxed as a REIT under the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended, which we refer to in this Report as the \"Code.\" To continue to qualify as a REIT, we must continue to meet certain tests which, among other things, generally require that our assets consist primarily of real estate assets, our income be derived primarily from real estate assets, and that we distribute at least 90% of our REIT taxable income (other than our net capital gains) to our stockholders annually. As a REIT, we generally will not be subject to U.S. federal income taxes at the corporate level on our net income to the extent we distribute such net income to our stockholders annually. In 2025, we declared total distributions of $1.72 per common share and paid dividends of $1.715 per common share.","zh":"UDR 選擇根據經修訂的 1986 年國內稅收法典（我們在本報告中稱為「法典」）作為 REIT 納稅。為了繼續獲得 REIT 資格，我們必須繼續滿足某些測試，這些測試通常要求我們的資產主要由房地產資產組成，我們的收入主要來自房地產資產，並且我們每年至少將 90% 的 REIT 應稅收入（淨資本收益除外）分配給我們的股東。作為房地產投資信託基金，只要我們每年向股東分配淨收入，我們通常不需要繳納公司層級的美國聯邦所得稅。 2025 年，我們宣布每股普通股分配總額為 1.72 美元，並支付每股普通股 1.715 美元的股利。"},{"en":"UDR was formed in 1972 as a Virginia corporation. In June 2003, we changed our state of incorporation from Virginia to Maryland. Our corporate offices are located at 1745 Shea Center Drive, Suite 200, Highlands Ranch, Colorado and our telephone number is (720) 283-6120. Our website is www.udr.com. The information contained on our website, including any information referred to in this Report as being available on our website, is not a part of or incorporated into this Report.","zh":"UDR 成立於 1972 年，是一家維吉尼亞公司。 2003 年 6 月，我們將公司註冊地從維吉尼亞州更改為馬裡蘭州。我們的公司辦事處位於 1745 Shea Center Drive, Suite 200, Highlands Ranch, Colorado，電話號碼為 (720) 283-6120。我們的網站是 www.udr.com。我們網站上包含的資訊，包括本報告中提及的在我們網站上提供的任何資訊，不屬於本報告的一部分，也不包含在本報告中。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"In total, over 10,000 training courses are available to our associates, spanning topics such as leasing skills, property maintenance, customer service, project management, and leadership development. In 2025, our associates collectively invested 32,508 hours in training, averaging 23 hours per full time associate. By the end of 2025, 99% of associates had completed annual IT security training, fair housing, harassment, workplace violence, diversity and inclusion, and business ethics training.","zh":"我們總共為員工提供了 10,000 多個培訓課程，涵蓋租賃技能、物業維護、客戶服務、專案管理和領導力發展等主題。 2025 年，我們的員工總共投入了 32,508 小時的培訓時間，平均每位全職員工投入了 23 小時。到 2025 年底，99% 的員工完成了年度 IT 安全培訓、公平住房、騷擾、工作場所暴力、多元化和包容性以及商業道德培訓。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition for new residents is generally intense across our markets. Some competing communities offer amenities that our communities do not have. Competing communities can use rental concessions or lower rents to obtain temporary competitive advantages. Also, some competing communities are larger or newer than our communities. The competitive position of each community is different depending upon many factors, including sub-market supply and demand. In addition, other real estate investors compete with us to acquire existing properties, redevelop existing properties, and to develop new properties. These competitors include insurance companies, pension and investment funds, public and private real estate companies, investment companies and other public and private apartment REITs, some of which may have greater resources, or lower capital costs, than we do.","zh":"我們的市場對新居民的競爭普遍非常激烈。一些競爭社區提供我們社區所沒有的便利設施。競爭社群可以利用租金優惠或降低租金來獲得暫時的競爭優勢。此外，有些競爭社區比我們的社區更大或更新。每個社區的競爭地位各不相同，取決於許多因素，包括子市場的供應和需求。此外，其他房地產投資者與我們競爭收購現有房產、重新開發現有房產、開發新房產。這些競爭對手包括保險公司、退休金和投資基金、公共和私人房地產公司、投資公司以及其他公共和私人公寓房地產投資信託基金，其中一些可能比我們擁有更多的資源或更低的資本成本。"},{"en":"We believe that, in general, we are well-positioned to compete effectively for residents and investments. We believe our competitive advantages include:","zh":"我們相信，整體而言，我們處於有利地位，可以有效競爭居民和投資。我們相信我們的競爭優勢包括："}],"segments":{},"peers":["MAA","ESS","CPT","REG","VMRK"]}}